          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("With the elven forest open for passage, Gweddry and his men resumed their journey through the northern Estmarks. After many days of mountainous travel, they were greatly relieved to see the walls of the northern outpost silhouetted against the horizon..."),
