      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_26",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "saved_Rilaka",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Rilaka",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "saved_Owaec",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Owaec",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("Alas! The northern outpost has been destroyed..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("Did you expect anything else? Owaec has either fled or perished and the undead hordes now march toward the River Weldyn. They must seek to overrun Wesnoth before the king can muster his armies."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:unstore_unit",
            variable: "saved_Owaec",
            x: 20,
            y: 19,
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Raraery",
            type: "Horseman",
            side: 2,
            x: 20,
            y: 18,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Raraery",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Raetharvan",
            type: "Peasant",
            side: 2,
            x: 19,
            y: 17,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Raetharvan",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("Hail, Gweddry!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("Hail, Owaec! I am stunned and relieved to see that you are still well. How did you escape the undead?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("Many of these farmers dug deep cellars connected to a network of caves. I hid as many villagers as I could once our scouts spotted the undead. They must have thought the villages abandoned, for they moved on swiftly westward, and yet..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("... I was not able to save everyone. Gweddry, their deaths weigh heavy on my heart."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("I am surprised you managed to save even yourself, much less anyone else. But compared to the havoc these undead seek to unleash on all Wesnoth, the deaths of a few peasants are hardly worth mourning."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("How can you say-"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("For now, I must study and consider how these undead can be defeated, and then we should leave before more arrive. Will you join us?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("No. I failed these villagers once. I will not do so again. They have survived the undead, but a gang of bandits exploits our weakness and now terrorizes these people. I cannot seem to find a way to defeat the outlaws; they hide in the village cellars whenever I send in my horsemen."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("I fear that until the undead are defeated, these villagers will never be truly safe. But if we can drive these bandits out, will you join us? From what Dacyn tells me, Wesnoth will need all of its soldiers if it is to survive what has come."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("If the situation is so dire, I am honor-bound to join you... but I know of no way to remove these bandits."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("You forget that I have many skills as the advisor to the Crown. I can reveal the bandits when our soldiers enter a village. However, this magic will require my full attention. I will not be able to battle them directly."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
