            kill: "yes",
            id: "Owaec,Gweddry",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "ne",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_unit_hidden",
            id: "Owaec,Gweddry",
            hidden: "no",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("Mage, pull your nose out of your books for a moment, would you? Gweddry and I have some questions about this invasion you speak of."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_42",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_43",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:teleport",
            id: "Dacyn",
            x: 16,
            y: 21,
            to_x: 15,
            to_y: 20,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Dacyn",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "sw",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_unit_hidden",
            id: "Dacyn",
            hidden: "no",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "revelations.ogg",
            play_once: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("I suppose you have a right to know of the adversary we face. Mal-Ravanal was, at first, a mage of the realm like me. His fall began during the reign of our previous king, Haldric VII..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("The greatest seer in the land, an elderly Sylph named Eryssa, came to Weldyn and spoke of the emergence of a power that threatened to corrupt Wesnoth’s greatest mages and eventually bring ruin to the entire kingdom. She offered only a small piece of cryptic advice, that avoiding this calamity would require a peerless wisdom to harness the use of tremendous power."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("The King endeavoured to seek this peerless savant. In all the land, there were two magi that clearly stood out from the rest. Myself, and my good friend Ravan, a mage from the east. The King, wishing to choose the best advisor, sent us both before Eryssa. Then he conversed with the seer privately. None know what was said, but when he came out he announced that the seer was dead, and she had... chosen... me as the King’s new advisor."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("Ravan took this quietly enough, or so I had thought, but it must have been more of a blow than I had realized. We drifted apart for a long while, and several years passed without me seeing my once close friend."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 2000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("One day, I received a message. Ravan was calling me north across the Great River and past the Listra, to an ancient sanctuary that we had once explored together in our younger years. At that time, I had still thought Ravan was my friend and a respected mage of the Light, so I obliged. It sounds foolish now, in hindsight, but I made the long journey north in the darkness of winter to the sanctuary and its hidden chambers."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("Even now, that dreadful scene is burned into my memory. At a mere glance, I could already sense the taint of black magic on that cloaked form. Ravan’s once bright aura was enshrouded by an impenetrable darkness, thick and potent and filled with terror. Before I could gather myself, hoarse and frightful voices sprang to life around me, a stream of foul incantations whose cacophonous sound clawed and tore at my body and soul. At that moment, I knew I was obliged to do whatever was necessary to excise this evil from the world."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("Before the incantation could finish, I summoned the utmost of my power and rended Ravan’s physical body. Yet even as I witnessed flesh and blood burn away into soot, a dark shadow arose from the ashen bones and dispersed throughout the sanctum. I knew then that death would be but a mere inconvenience to one so skilled in the mystic arts, and that Ravan’s spirit would return one day..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 3000,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "wanderer.ogg",
            play_once: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("As it has now, to finally fulfill the prophecy that the Sylph spoke of all those years ago."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("Yes. But hope is not yet lost. After pondering the matter once more, I have come to a conclusion. I do not have the power to defeat Mal-Ravanal as I am now. We must travel north, away from Wesnoth, back to the sanctuary where I had defeated Ravan once before."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("And leave our countrymen to fend for themselves in a time of war? This does not sit right with me."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("If we fail to defeat Mal-Ravanal, no effort of ours will be sufficient to withstand the endless armies of the dead. Our blood is limited and the more it is spilled, the more their strength grows. Only by using the power from the sanctuary to destroy the Lich can we find salvation."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("Far though this journey may take us, if it is necessary to defeating this great evil, we have no choice but to make it."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("Very well. The Great River can be crossed near Soradoc. We could reach the garrison there, contact the Crown, and gather supplies for our journey."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("The entire undead army is between us and Soradoc. They even may have already taken the city itself. We should avoid that battle and cross the Great River further east, behind the undead lines."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("If undead are attacking Soradoc, that is all the more reason to travel west! I will not stand by and let my comrades die while I cravenly flee the battle."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("Peace, friends. You both speak wisely. Allow me to cast the deciding vote."),
          },
          {
            tag: "dialogue",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "message",
                speaker: "Gweddry",
                text: _("My decision is..."),
              },
              {
                tag: "choice",
                text: _("Cross the Great River to the east, behind enemy lines. <i>(normal)</i>"),
                event: "ev_41_opt0",
              },
              {
                tag: "choice",
                text: _("Cross the Great River west in Wesnoth, near Soradoc. <i>(challenging)</i>"),
                event: "ev_41_opt1",
              },
            ],
          },
        ],
      },
